{"name": "AGX GP", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>HARD - FAST - FUTURISTIC</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In AGX, you unleash your Anti\u2011Gravity vehicle\u2019s Xtreme abilities to build blistering speed, win races, and conquer varied challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SPEED</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"334\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250680/extras/9b531f0932305fb4128afde0f96e392d.poster.avif?t=1781891065\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250680/extras/9b531f0932305fb4128afde0f96e392d.webm?t=1781891065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deploy 5 Xtreme vehicle abilities \u2014 designed to maximise your speed, demand precision, and reward player skill.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FLOW</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"334\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250680/extras/ab95fd11a1860f2359cef9a638767daa.poster.avif?t=1781891065\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250680/extras/ab95fd11a1860f2359cef9a638767daa.webm?t=1781891065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">25+ adrenaline\u2011fueled, highly replayable tracks \u2014 with deceptively simple mechanics that immerse you into a true competitive \u201cflow state.\u201d</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DEPTH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"334\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250680/extras/c1e5cfe39dbc5181bf9d63bdf7f160ec.poster.avif?t=1781891065\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250680/extras/c1e5cfe39dbc5181bf9d63bdf7f160ec.webm?t=1781891065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Conquer 125+ challenges across 7 diverse game modes in 3 different speed classes creating more than 375 events \u2014 From full-scale Racing Championships to competitive skill based trials, every event pushes your abilities to the limit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>STYLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"334\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250680/extras/0dbf545b8c02d835c653d8d038f5b113.poster.avif?t=1781891065\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250680/extras/0dbf545b8c02d835c653d8d038f5b113.webm?t=1781891065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Race across distinct locations \u2014 from futuristic Earth to the lunar frontier \u2014 wrapped in a clean, crisp visual design.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>AND MORE...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Extensive Customisation options for the Vehicle, UI and Track Style! Full Photo-mode, Online Leaderboards and more!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GOALS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Optimized for Native 4K at 120 fps on Recommend Spec PC. (Smooth 60 fps on Steam Deck.) </p> </div>", "short_desc": "AGX is a heart thumpingly fast, Anti-Gravity racing game. It's lightning\u2011fast action and Xtreme ability\u2011based gameplay, will push your reactions and skills to the limit! Welcome To AGX!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250680/f5138c50ec1fe20a15d9043051980d78c7638bbc/header.jpg?t=1781891065", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Racing", "Driving", "Sci-fi", "Arcade", "PvP", "3D"], "developers": "Typ1 Games", "publishers": "Typ1 Games", "release_date": "Q4 2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4250680", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "8 June 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/rgF6q18K5-M", "first_seen": 1780869600.0, "review_rank": 463}